  m_text: 'There wasn''t any good way to say it, but the man was most certainly, without any doubt, lost. He checked for signs on his left, he checked for signs on his right, he looked up and down and all around, but no matter what he did he was unable to ignore the inevitable facts laid out right in front of him: he was simply lost. And there was no doubt about it.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
