--- !u!114 &1169875077560646524
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7629223634055348751}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'And what a shame as well, for if the man did not become un-lost within the given hours, he would miss the big picnic being hosted by Barnaby Bear himself.

    "A picnic?" the man questioned, "I don''t remember anything about a picnic. Is that why I''ve been so lost? I''ve been looking for a bear''s party this whole time?"

    Why of course you were, there''s no better reason to be lost is there. In fact, if I were mistakened, and I most certainly am not, there''s practically no better reason in the whole wide world to be lost.

    "I suppose so," the man inquired, "but who are you exactly?"

    With nothing more to do or say, the man proceeded along his route.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6190da2394d123f478209b446c906d21, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 8555249785656010089, guid: 6190da2394d123f478209b446c906d21, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
  m_fontColor32:
